                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Mistakes from the previous game were fixed.  The slowliness of acquiring a combined \"item\" is faster and the items are far better hidden now too.\n\nThis one also feels somewhat more like the previous Dark Parables.  Brienne, the Red Hood Huntress is overly beautiful and puts a shame to the other characters in previous games...  Lol...\n\nThey tried their hand at different puzzles.  Harder rules.  Can't say my brain followed all of 'em, but alright.\n\nStill fun/relaxing.  Thanks you!  :D :> :)\n\n(This game gives me a \"False Positive\" upon installation and well...  Being a VN reader that's nothing to freak out about.  (Unless you got it from a shady place that is...)  But if it unsettles you, then there is your warning.)",
